Easy to Extend

Groq / Anthropic / Ollama: Just create a new class implementing LLMClient
LangChain: Replace OpenAIClient with a LangChain ChatOpenAI or any other runnable
Local models: Use llama-cpp-python, Ollama, or vLLM
